### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-shelf
### The terminal UI: the drop shelf (Phase T7).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-shelf.ftl.

## Shelf dialog

tui-shelf-remove = Remove
tui-shelf-clear = Clear
tui-shelf-empty-body = Use “Add to shelf” in a file's menu to collect items from different folders, then copy or move them all at once.
tui-shelf-hints = Up/Down item · Space mark · Enter go to · Del remove · Esc close
